  "content": "<center>\n\t<img style=\"width: 1142px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/wordmarks/outlined/cracked/f64_wordmark.png\">\n\t<h1>Minecraft 必備的 64x 紋理包。</h1>\n\t<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft-bedrock/addons/faithful-64x-bedrock\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n\t\t<img\n\t\t\tstyle=\"width: 1142px;\"\n\t\t\tsrc=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/bedrock_button.png\"\n\t\t\talt=\"在此取得基岩版資源包\"\n\t\t>\n\t</a>\n</center>\n<hr>\n<p>\n    將 Minecraft 紋理升級的合理下一步。與 Faithful 32x 一樣，此資源包基於預設美術風格——以四倍解析度精心重製，並加入恰到好處的額外細節，帶來完美的原版風格 Minecraft 體驗。 \n\t<br><br>\n    藉由直接以其 32x 對應紋理為基礎，資源包之間達到絕佳一致性，且品質持續精進。 \\\n\t如果您喜愛精緻的資源包，但仍想保留原版風味，這個資源包就是為您而設！\n\n</p>\n<center>\n\t<a href=\"https://discord.gg/sN9YRQbBv7\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n\t\t<img style=\"width: 1142px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/discord_button.png\" alt=\"Discord 伺服器\">\n\t</a>\n  <br><br>\n\t<a href=\"https://faithfulpack.net/\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n\t\t<img style=\"width: 1142px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/website_button.png\" alt=\"官方網站\">\n\t</a>\n</center>\n<hr>\n<center><h2>其他資訊：</h2></center>\n<p>\n\t如果您有任何意見回饋、想回報錯誤，或需要一般協助，\n\t請加入上方的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/sN9YRQbBv7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Discord</a> 伺服器、建立\n\t<a href=\"https://github.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Faithful-64x-Java/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">GitHub 問題</a>，\n\t或在下方留言。如有任何商業或發行相關問題，請參考我們的\n\t<a href=\"http://faithfulpack.net/license\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">授權條款</a>。\n\t<br><br>\n\t所有紋理和附加元件均由志願者在空閒時間貢獻提供。\n\t任何人都可以透過上方連結的 Discord 伺服器提交紋理，或製作\n\t<a href=\"http://faithfulpack.net/addons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">附加元件</a>\n\t以在我們網站上正式列出。開始前，請務必閱讀我們的\n\t<a href=\"https://docs.faithfulpack.net/pages/textures/f64-texturing-guidelines\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">紋理製作指南</a>，\n\t其中精確概述了資源包的藝術風格。\n\t<br><br>\n\t每個資源包都在我們的 <a href=\"faithfulpack.net\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">網站</a>、\n\t<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/faithful_resource_pack/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CurseForge</a>、\n\t<a href=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/member/faithful_resource_pack/submissions/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Planet Minecraft</a>、\n\t和 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Faithful-Resource-Pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Modrinth</a> 上架，\n\t部分資源包亦在 <a href=\"https://mcpedl.com/user/faithful-resource-pack/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">MCPEDL</a>\n\t和 <a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/members/Faithful_Resource_Pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Minecraft 論壇</a> 上架。\n\t<strong>從其他任何網站下載皆為非官方、不受支援且可能具有危險性！</strong>\n\t請記得上網時保持安全。\n</p>\n<hr>\n<center><h2>我們的其他專案：</h2></center>\n<div style=\"text-align: center\">\n\t<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/faithful-32x\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n\t\t<img\n\t\t\tstyle=\"width: 1142px;\"\n\t\t\tsrc=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/f32_button.png\"\n\t\t\talt=\"Faithful 32x\"\n\t\t>\n\t</a>\n\t<br><br>\n\t<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/classic-faithful-32x-programmer-art\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n\t\t<img\n\t\t\tstyle=\"width: 1142px;\"\n\t\t\tsrc=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/cf32_button.png\"\n\t\t\talt=\"Classic Faithful 32x\"\n\t\t>\n\t</a>\n\t<br><br>\n\t<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/classic-faithful-32x-jappa\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n\t\t<img\n\t\t\tstyle=\"width: 1142px;\"\n\t\t\tsrc=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/cf32j_button.png\"\n\t\t\talt=\"Classic Faithful 32x Jappa\"\n\t\t>\n\t</a>\n\t<br><br>\n\t<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/classic-faithful-64x\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n\t\t<img\n\t\t\tstyle=\"width: 1142px;\"\n\t\t\tsrc=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faithful-Resource-Pack/Branding/main/social_media/buttons/cf64j_button.png\"\n\t\t\talt=\"Classic Faithful 64x Jappa\"\n\t\t>\n\t</a>\n</div>",
